{"name": "Chaos Islands", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/884021bdea2983574e453d6f33085f7c.poster.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/884021bdea2983574e453d6f33085f7c.webm?t=1786951081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">City-building meets deck-building in Chaos Islands. Defend against demons, explore the skies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"219\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/7af3239a7d695853da01fb059b1703f0.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Establish and expand your floating settlement in the skies, strategically placing structures to gather essential resources. Raise defenses to protect against demon attacks and ensure the survival of your community. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"348\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/b362ed4c7b4b91d2c94170801b688d0d.poster.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/b362ed4c7b4b91d2c94170801b688d0d.webm?t=1786951081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"219\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/c5c63f7b06b965ed662c5509ff87b4e6.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defend your settlement with diverse strategies and card abilities to repel demon assaults and keep your settlement safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"348\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/78b28239f8d5c5d2edf4cc7630dc4a7f.poster.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/78b28239f8d5c5d2edf4cc7630dc4a7f.webm?t=1786951081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"219\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/33fdaeb59f999f0b564a3cfe4c3b9d36.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your arsenal by collecting cards that represent various constructions and spells empowering you to adapt and overcome the challenges of the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"348\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/ee58828285da6415c4ef9e51aa21ac08.poster.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/ee58828285da6415c4ef9e51aa21ac08.webm?t=1786951081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"219\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/8e3aac3c464e95b19107c79e346207a1.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate through dynamic events that shape the fate of your settlement, presenting both opportunities and challenges as you strive to survive in the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"348\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/52c6fd2eee7b477be9b8931b1e6a922b.poster.avif?t=1786951081\" width=\"616\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/extras/52c6fd2eee7b477be9b8931b1e6a922b.webm?t=1786951081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Chaos Islands is a city-builder that unites deck-building and tower defense mechanics with roguelite elements. As the last bastion of humanity forced to escape to the skies to hide from invading forces of demons. Protect your settlement and do not let the evil forces pass.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891320/7ffb2c03fcbc2a7860127e74f16eb79663f0db71/header.jpg?t=1786951081", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["City Builder", "Deckbuilding", "Roguelite", "Turn-Based Combat", "Colony Sim", "Building"], "developers": "Sirex Productions", "publishers": "Sirex Productions", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2891320", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "17 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/sU4O85xvZAI", "first_seen": 1786917600.0, "review_rank": 92}